-- EffectfulHost x — derived class instances via GND.
--
-- These lift the 'Eff (BaseEffectfulHostRow x)' instances above through the
-- newtype so that upstream *T-scaffold ('PerformEventT', 'PostBuildT',
-- 'TriggerEventT') can wrap 'EffectfulHost x' directly. Every derivation is
-- via 'GeneralizedNewtypeDeriving' — the newtype's underlying 'Eff' already
-- has the instance, we're just labelling it.
